{"unit_id": "tag:03NT:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n因此可以将上同调（cohomology）定义为右（right）导出函子（derived functors），来自截面（sections）函子（functor）：若<MATH_0001>且<MATH_0002>，<MATH_0003>，其中<MATH_0004>是单射（injective）消解（resolution）。为此，应检查函子（functor）<MATH_0005>是左正合（left exact）的。这确实成立，也是范畴（category）<MATH_0006>为阿贝尔（abelian）的部分原因，见《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理<REF_0001>。关于景上的上同调（cohomology on sites）的更一般讨论（包括整体截面（global sections）函子（functor）及其右（right）导出函子（derived functors）），见《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》节<REF_0002>。\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "right", "target_term": "右"}, {"source_term": "derived functors", "target_term": "导出函子"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "resolution", "target_term": "消解"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "left exact", "target_term": "左正合"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模"}, {"source_term": "cohomology on sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "right", "target_term": "右"}, {"source_term": "derived functors", "target_term": "导出函子"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "right", "target_term": "右", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "derived functors", "target_term": "导出函子", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "injec