{"unit_id": "tag:03NX:statement", "translation": "第一个条件对应于fp，代表<TEXTITOPEN_0001>忠实平坦（fid<ACCENT_0001>lement plat）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，即法语中的忠实平坦（faithfully flat），第二个对应于qc，<TEXTITOPEN_0002>准紧（quasi-compact）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。当第二个条件成立时，第一个条件的第二部分是不必要的。\n", "allowed_english": ["fp", "qc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "fid<ACCENT_0001>lement plat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "准紧"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "fid<ACCENT_0001>lement plat", "target_term": "忠实平坦", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "准紧", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}], "notes": []}
