{"unit_id": "tag:03NV:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n看来，此引理允许我们定义fpqc景（site），对于范畴（category），由概形（schemes）组成。然而，考虑fpqc拓扑（fpqc topology）时，会出现一个集合（set）论问题，见《拓扑（Topologies）》节<REF_0001>。这来自要求景（sites）是“小（small）”的，而任何小范畴（small category），由概形（schemes）组成，都无法包含共尾（cofinal）系统，由fpqc覆盖（fpqc coverings）组成，针对一个给定的非空（nonempty）概形（scheme）。尽管严格来说，这并不阻止我们定义“部分”fpqc景（sites），但这样做似乎不谨慎。变通办法是允许针对fpqc拓扑（fpqc topology）的层（sheaf）的概念（见下文），但禁止考虑范畴（category），由所有fpqc层（sheaves）组成。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "fpqc topology", "target_term": "fpqc拓扑"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "small category", "target_term": "小范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "cofinal", "target_term": "共尾"}, {"source_term": "fpqc coverings", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "fpqc topology", "target_term": "fpqc拓扑"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "fpqc topology", "target_term": "fpqc拓扑", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "small category", "target_term": "小范畴", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "cofinal", "target_term": "共尾", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "fpqc coverings", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03X6:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。范畴（category），由<MATH_0002>上的概形（schemes）组成，记为<MATH_0003>。考虑函子（functor）<MATH_0004>，换言之，即预层（presheaf），取值于集合（sets）。称<MATH_0005><TEXTITOPEN_0001>满足fpqc拓扑的层性质（satisfies the sheaf property for the fpqc topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若对于每个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）<MATH_0006>，由概形（schemes）组成，定义在<MATH_0007>上，图（diagram）（<REF_0001>）是等化子（equalizer）图（diagram）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "satisfies the sheaf property for the fpqc topology", "target_term": "满足fpqc拓扑的层性质"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "satisfies the sheaf property for the fpqc topology", "target_term": "满足fpqc拓扑的层性质", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "景、上同调及fpqc拓扑；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": 